  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-4-6/202246147418515.jpg",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<section style=\"line-height:2;letter-spacing:2px;padding:0px 8px;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;font-size:16px;\"><section style=\"text-align:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><br /><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-4-6/202246147418515.jpg\" title=\"深农图（已码）\" alt=\"深农图（已码）\" /><br /><br /></section><section style=\"line-height:1.8;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"text-indent:0em;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">近年来随着城市人口不断增加以及国民消费水平日益提高，对农产品市场的管理要求逐步提升，农产品批发市场作为人流、物流、资金流、信息流高度汇集的综合体，如何保证农产品批发市场日常运营过程当中的安全问题成为了市场亟待解决的重要问题。   <span style=\"text-indent:0em;\">       </span></p></section><section style=\"line-height:1.8;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">面向农产品批发市场，古河云科技开发了<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">数字孪生安全管控平台</span>，以“安全隐患评估、信息化建设、可持续增值服务”为设计思路，依托线上线下结合的全新服务模式，为园区量身打造了多样持续的信息化与安全服务体系。一方面，实现园区安全、环保、安防、消防、应急等业务的提质增效，另一方面，通过持续多样的服务为园区提供源源不断的能力支持，强化园区安全保障能力，促进园区良性可持续发展，打通农批市场安全管理的“最后一公里”。</p></section><section style=\"line-height:1.8;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:6px;\">在<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">数字孪生安全管控平台1.0版本</span>中，古河云科技围绕客户在三维可视化、运维管理、电气安全以及安防管理等业务的需求，为客户打造了集BIM可视化管理、电气安全、视频监控、运维工单、设备维保等功能于一体的<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">农批安全信息化管理系统。</span></p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:6px;\">在一期项目成功交付的基础上，公司针对客户日渐增长的需求，对如何让安全管理更全面，杜绝市场安全隐患的发生与快速处理，达到事前感知、事中快速调度处理、事后追溯等关键问题进行了深入的调研与分析，最终形成了对日常安全管控工作，包括消防安全管理、垃圾分类巡检管理，资产安全管理、商户信息管理、强电间安全管理、安全培训以及疫情管控等功能的全面升级，打造了全新的<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">数字孪生安全管控平台2.0版本。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0em;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p></section><section style=\"position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;margin:10px 0%;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;width:33px;box-shadow:#000000 0px 0px 0px;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;align-self:center;line-height:0;background-color:;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"position:static;transform:rotatez(37deg);-webkit-transform:rotatez(37deg);-moz-transform:rotatez(37deg);-o-transform:rotatez(37deg);box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"justify-content:flex-start;transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);margin:2px 0% -3px;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section class=\"group-empty\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:4px;height:22px;vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;background-color:#0391e3;border-width:0px;border-radius:16px;border-style:none;border-color:#3e3e3e;box-shadow:#4abba8 9px -6px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;width:auto;align-self:center;min-width:10%;max-width:100%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"margin:0px 0%;justify-content:flex-start;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"padding:0px 13px;font-size:18px;text-align:center;color:#0391e3;line-height:1;box-sizing:border-box;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">总体架构</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">古河云数字孪生安全管控平台2.0版本，充分运用IoT、云计算、大数据、人工智能等先进技术，以“智能化+数字化”为核心规划理念，以安全园区一期建设平台为基础，市场业务痛点为依托，上承接集团总部平台，跟随政策法规的脚步，下接整合软、硬件等基础设施，为农批市场提供完整的安全服务体系，打造了一站式农批市场安全管控平台。</p></section><section style=\"text-align:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><br /></section><section style=\"position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;margin:10px 0%;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;width:33px;box-shadow:#000000 0px 0px 0px;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;align-self:center;line-height:0;background-color:;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"position:static;transform:rotatez(37deg);-webkit-transform:rotatez(37deg);-moz-transform:rotatez(37deg);-o-transform:rotatez(37deg);box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"justify-content:flex-start;transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform:translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);margin:2px 0% -3px;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section class=\"group-empty\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:4px;height:22px;vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;background-color:#0391e3;border-width:0px;border-radius:16px;border-style:none;border-color:#3e3e3e;box-shadow:#4abba8 9px -6px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;width:auto;align-self:center;min-width:10%;max-width:100%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"margin:0px 0%;justify-content:flex-start;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"padding:0px 13px;font-size:18px;text-align:center;color:#0391e3;line-height:1;box-sizing:border-box;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">功能详情</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p></section><section style=\"position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;margin:10px 0px;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:bottom;width:auto;background-color:;margin:0px;min-width:10%;max-width:100%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;padding:2px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-color:#008fdb;align-self:flex-end;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align:center;color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">01</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:bottom;width:auto;align-self:flex-end;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:10%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0px;padding:2px 2px 2px 7px;border-bottom:1px solid #008fdb;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">消防管道安全</p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height:1.8;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">通过三维可视化、物联网、大数据等相关技术，将消防管网、灭火器设备全面集中监控与管理，构建一套包含安防、电气、消防三位一体的安全园区管理平台，可通过平台统一<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">查看园区内所有灭火设备分布，消防管网分布，消防水流向以及消防水压力等信息数据。</span></p></section><section style=\"text-align:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><br /></section><section style=\"text-align:center;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-4-6/2022461012329259.png\" alt=\"444\" title=\"444\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p></section><section style=\"position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;margin:10px 0px;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:bottom;width:auto;background-color:;margin:0px;min-width:10%;max-width:100%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;padding:2px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-color:#008fdb;align-self:flex-end;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align:center;color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">02</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:bottom;width:auto;align-self:flex-end;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:10%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0px;padding:2px 2px 2px 7px;border-bottom:1px solid #008fdb;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">消防设施安全</p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height:1.8;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">对接传统消防报警控制器设备，远程监测显示消防报警控制器、消防水管的运行状态，并集成显示手报、烟感、喷淋、防火卷帘门、防火门、消防广播、排烟风机、应急照明的位置分布和运行状态，<span style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\">同时支持历史数据汇总及信息查看。</span></p><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\" /></p></section><section style=\"position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section style=\"display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;margin:10px 0px;position:static;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:bottom;width:auto;background-color:;margin:0px;min-width:10%;max-width:100%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;padding:2px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-color:#008fdb;align-self:flex-end;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align:center;color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\">03</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:bottom;width:auto;align-self:flex-end;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:10%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0px;padding:2px 2px 2px 7px;border-bottom:1px solid #008fdb;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;box-sizing:border-box;\"><section style=\"color:#008fdb;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">消防用水安全</p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height:1.8;box-sizing:border-box;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p style=\"padding:0px;box-sizing: